what is going on everybody welcome back  to the cosmic wonder I'm Warren Thompson  and yesterday we were hit with some  insane news news that is forever going  to change DC as we know it the news that  Henry Cavill is officially done as  Superman yesterday on Instagram Henry  Cavill announced that he met with James  Gunn and Peter Safran and DC and he has  done a Superman not because he wanted to  be done as Superman but because James  Gunn and Peter Safran have other plans  for the DCU including a new Superman  movie that is actually going to be  revealed soon according to James Gunn  but will not involve Henry Cavill and of  course we're going to be talking about  that in this video and talking about the  entire future of DC what does this mean  now that Henry Cavill is out is Jason  Momoa safe is gal gadosafe who is  staying who is leaving heck we don't  even know if the rock is safe as Black  Adam right now in the DCU one thing is  very clear James Gunn and Peter Safran  have a vision and it seems like they  have decided what is best for the DCU  moving forward and nothing's really  going to get in their way including  someone as iconic as Henry Cavill  Superman who the fans truly do love and  feel like he was done kind of dirty with  this but what is really happening over  at DC right now like I mentioned it's  very clear right now that James Gunn and  Peter Safran have an idea a vision of  what the DCU should be and they have  created a plan for their movies coming  up their TV shows coming up their games  coming up because James Gunn said it's  all connecting even video games some of  the video games are going to connect and  James Gunn and Peter saffron recently  took a little retreat they spent some  time over in Colorado simply doing  nothing but writing what they call the  DC Bible basically what they did was  come up with how everything is going to  connect in their universe and actually  they are submitting all of their plans  to Warner Brothers Discovery very very  soon and considering the fact that Henry  Cavill met with James Gunn and Peter  Safran and that was the end of it it  looks like they have everything complete  it looks like they have their full  vision ready to go so last night after  Henry Cavill posted his statement on  Instagram James Gunn took to Twitter and  announced a couple of things himself now  real quick if you didn't hear about  Henry Cavill last night or you didn't  read the post this is what it says I  have just had a meeting with James Gunn  and Peter Safran and it's sad news  everyone I will after all not be  returning as Superman after being told  by the studio to announce my return back  in October prior to their hire this news  isn't the easiest but that's life The  Changing of the Guard is something that  happens I respect that James and Peter  have a universe to build I wish them and  all involved with the new universe the  best of luck in the happiest of Fortunes  for those who have been on my side  through the years we can mourn for a bit  but then we must remember Superman is  still around everything he stands for  still exists and the examples he sets  for us are still there my turn to where  the cape has passed but what Superman  stands for never will it's been a fun  ride with you all onwards and upwards  it's extremely sad it really is but  Henry Cavill responded to this perfectly  I think with true class but besides  Henry Cavill no longer being Superman  here's what stands out to me and what he  said and I think it's pretty important  he says that James and Peter have a  universe to build then he says I wish  them and all involved with the new  universe the best of luck this pretty  much means that James Gunn and Peter  Safran are kind of resetting everything  we thought that it might be sort of a  soft reboot but now that Henry Cavill is  out of Superman it's looking like it's  going to be an extremely hard reboot and  a report came out by The Hollywood  Reporter stating that gal gadot's Wonder  Woman 3 has been scrapped and Patty  Jenkins came out and said thank you for  all the time and all the love that we've  given Wonder Woman in her movies so it's  looking like Gal Gadot is done as well  James Gunn and Peter saffron have a  completely new DC slate ready to go that  they're going to reveal to us relatively  soon and it looks like it's not going to  involve any of the old characters so for  those who were hoping that Zack Snyder's  Justice League would be kind of given a  Redemption Arc here it doesn't look like  it at all in fact I'm pretty sure one of  James guns and Peter safran's priorities  was to kind of move away from that after  the news that Henry Cavill was done as  Superman was announced yesterday this is  what James Gunn said on Twitter Peter  and I have a DC slate ready to go which  we couldn't be more over the moon about  we'll be able to share some exciting  information about our first projects at  the beginning of the new year among  those on the Slate is Superman in the  initial stages our story will be  focusing on an earlier part of  Superman's life so the character will  not be played by Henry Cavill but we  just had a great meeting with Henry and  we're big fans and we talked about a  number of exciting possibilities to work  together in the future this is big news  right here and I'll come back to this in  just a second somebody asked James Gunn  about the Superman movie stating that  it's being a part of the Slate so they  assume it's a movie in which James Gunn  replied yes so this new Superman Project  is going to be a movie he then stated  that he is writing the script for the  new Superman movie and has been for a  while but he doesn't know who is  directing it yet he also mentioned  something kind of exciting one user  asked him if Ben afflecked could direct  and he replied with met with Ben  yesterday precisely because he wants to  direct and we want him to direct we just  have to find the right project that  implies that Ben Affleck's Batman is  most likely done as well however what  James Gunn said is very interesting when  he said they had a great meeting with  Henry and their big fans and they talked  about a number of exciting possibilities  to work together in the future so as I  mentioned James Gunn clearly has a very  clear path that he wants to take the DCU  down and considering the fact that  they're doing a new Superman movie  that's going to focus on the earlier  parts of Superman's life as in when he  is younger that implies that the DCU  really is resetting and they're starting  over and they're going to start when  these characters are younger but that  doesn't mean that when these characters  eventually grow up we could see older  versions of them played by some of the  original actors perhaps there's a  Superman movie that said in the future  after this one that's going to come out  and Henry Cavill could return to play  Superman it kind of sounds like that is  one of the possibilities that James Gunn  is talking about of ways to work  together in the future with Henry Cavill  plus not to mention it does seem like DC  might explore the Multiverse and if they  start from scratch and set it up the  right way it can be done in a very very  excellent way and that opens it up for  all of these original characters to  return Gal Gadot Ben Affleck Jason Momoa  and of course Henry Cavill now Aquaman 2  is still set to come out and so is  Shazam 2. however their Futures are kind  of unknown right now in fact it looks  like and is very very hinted that Jason  Momoa might actually be playing Lobo in  fact James Gunn himself kind of hinted  at this and Jason Momoa honestly would  make a perfect Lobo and that probably  means that he is done as Aquaman as well  so we no longer have Henry Cavill as  Superman Gal Gadot looks like she is  done as Wonder Woman and Jason Momoa  might be done as Aquaman and I don't  think Ben Affleck just coming back as  Batman and given everything that has  happened into Ezra Miller I'm pretty  sure Ezra's done as well so it truly  does seem like they are scrapping the  entire old DC Universe and they're going  to be completely starting a new one and  the question is is this good or bad fans  are reacting in very very different ways  to this news some really don't like  James Gunn right now because they loved  Henry Cavill as Superman some don't like  him because they wanted the Snyder verse  restored but some actually see that this  could be a very very good thing and I  personally think that it could be a very  very good thing I am sad to see all of  these old characters go and the actors  that played them I think they were all  fantastic however DC has been in a rut  and their plan has been all over the  place they've been messy and what they  really need is some true Direction and  it seems like that's what James Gunn and  Peter saffron have it seems like they  know what the DCU needs and they're  really not going to let anything get in  the way of them making it great  including getting rid of some very  beloved actors and characters but they  have a vision and they're going for it  and I'm really excited to see what  happens and right now I think this is  kind of make or break for the DCU if  James Gunn and Peter saffron don't pull  this off and DC doesn't bounce back I  think a lot of people are probably going  to be done with DC of course there will  always be fans and there's always going  to be another chance but right now  people are even petitioning for Warner  Brothers to keep Henry Cavill and fire  James Gunn so fans are really divided  right now and I think if this fails it's  going to be really really bad for DC but  Peter Safran and James Gunn both have  really good track records when it comes  to movies James Gunn has been very  successful with the Guardians of the  Galaxy franchise directing Guardians of  the Galaxy one through three and the  Christmas holiday special and of course  he brought us the suicide squad the  newer one and The Peacemaker series both  of which were fantastic Peter Safran has  also worked on some great DC projects  and other movie projects as well that  have been really good and they're both  fans they're both fans of DC so they  don't want anything to screw up they  don't want to ruin the DCU they want to  restore it they want to revive it they  want to make DC great and they have a  plan they have their Full Slate planned  out which means they most likely are  doing phases Now The Rock has teased  that Black Adam was the first movie of  phase one however the rock also said  Henry Cavill was back and some other  things and Peter saffron and James Gunn  came in and basically negated what he  said he said all of those things before  they were put in charge so unfortunately  we don't really know if they're going to  be doing phases but since James Gunn  used the word slate it does seem like  they are which is good because we need  that structure for DC that is one thing  that DC has lacked structure and a clear  direction of where they're going to go  instead of being all over the place like  we were before everybody was pretty  confused about what was really happening  with DC and the DC EU before but it  seems like James and Peter have a very  clear vision of what they're going to be  going for so hopefully this is a brand  new start for DC hopefully fans can give  these new actors and characters a chance  and hopefully the franchise is about to  make a very very good comeback but hey  let us know what you you think about  this in the comments down below are you  happy are you sad are you looking  forward to the future let us know all  your thoughts down below also don't  forget to like the video and subscribe  to stay up to date with all DC news for  live updates you can follow us on  Instagram and Twitter and as always  thank you all so much for watching wolf  wolf

